{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":84665,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793455799343,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2019,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aduXo3ZzY8TzhXKnrOzxKn1Z4sD.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1634768","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ex, Reina, Tao, and Shane are travelers who journey between Story Zones, places where a single story is repeated over and over again. In the newest zone they've arrived at, they save a girl being attacked by a monster. The villagers tell her the girl's name is \"Little Red Riding Hood\", but she disappears into the forest...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sx3DbysxK2spATA9hDS4xW7KytU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sx3DbysxK2spATA9hDS4xW7KytU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/84665/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1659767","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The heroes find themselves in Don Quixote's story zone. But instead of the story proceeding like it should, the people are being attacked by hordes of devils. The sky has turned an eerie red, and the whole zone is about to collapse. The heroes act to try and stop it, but they meet a surprising person...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcQyY8OKvYGl3ASXdkAikrFgOGm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zcQyY8OKvYGl3ASXdkAikrFgOGm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/84665/season/1/episode/2"},{"id